/E (        Labour cooperatives have many skilled workers, but there is no proper digital platform to connect them with customers. Private platforms currently dominate this market, so cooperative workers are underutilized. Our solution is to create a cooperative-owned digital marketplace that connects verified workers with households and institutions while ensuring fair wages, worker welfare and consumer trust.)
